Subject: [PATCH] Concept: Irr
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Irr G is the set of irreducible complex characters of a group G: the functions G → ℂ that are characters of some finite-dimensional irreducible complex representation of G.

Candidate copies-CauchySchwarzProjection-irr, saves 564 tokens.
